# Environment Variables - Plant Saathi AI

## Frontend (.env)
VITE_SATELLITE_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:3001
VITE_BACKEND_API_KEY=your-secure-api-key-here

## Backend Proxy (backend-proxy/.env)
GEE_PROJECT_ID=your-gee-project-id
GEE_PRIVATE_KEY="-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\nYour key\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----"
GEE_CLIENT_EMAIL=your-account@project.iam.gserviceaccount.com
OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=your-openweather-key
BACKEND_API_KEY=your-secure-api-key-here
PORT=3001
